  "text": "📘 Guide Best Deadlock Cheats in 2026 — Review & Comparison Review of the best private cheats for Valve's Deadlock. Comparing features, safety, and prices. Which Deadlock cheat to choose? 📅 April 9, 2026 ✍️ IVSOFTE Team 📋 Contents ▾ Deadlock is Valve’s new hero shooter that quickly gained popularity. The game combines shooter and MOBA elements: gunplay, hero abilities, creep lanes, towers, and a souls system. Demand for Deadlock cheats is growing — let’s review what’s available and what to look for. Deadlock Anti-Cheat Deadlock uses VAC (Valve Anti-Cheat) — Valve’s user-mode anti-cheat. VAC operates in Ring 3 (user mode), has no kernel component, and relies on signature scanning and wave bans . This makes Deadlock more lenient toward cheats than games with EAC, BattlEye, or Vanguard. However, VAC has an unpleasant trait — silent data collection : a cheat might work for weeks, then a ban wave hits. Valve is also actively developing VACNet — an ML system for detecting suspicious behavior, similar to the one used in CS2. More about how VAC works in our anti-cheat overview . Available Deadlock Cheats 1. Mason Deadlock Mason Deadlock — internal cheat from the proven Mason lineup. Features: Aim Assist — aimbot with FOV, smooth, bone selection settings. Adapted for Deadlock hero hitboxes Visuals / ESP — displaying players through walls (boxes, health, distance), highlighting creeps, items, and objectives Misc — additional utilities Best for: those who want a full internal feature set from a reliable developer with a proven loader. 2. Phoenix Deadlock Phoenix Deadlock — cheat focused on visuals and information advantage. Best for: those who prefer ESP and map awareness. 3. Coconut Deadlock Coconut Deadlock — internal with ESP (boxes around players) and basic functionality. Easy to launch and configure. Best for: those who want a basic but working internal at an affordable price. 4. Byster Deadlock Byster Deadlock — another option with visuals and aimbot. Important Features for Deadlock Deadlock isn’t a classic shooter — it’s a hybrid. This affects feature importance: Player ESP — knowing all 12 player positions on the map is a huge advantage. Deadlock’s map is large with many transitions between lanes and jungle areas Aimbot with hero support — each hero has unique hitboxes and abilities. The aimbot must correctly handle different models Item/Creep ESP — highlighting jungle camps, soul deposits, urns. Efficient soul farming is the key to winning in Deadlock Hero ability tracking — tracking enemy ability cooldowns (if supported) Comparison: What to Choose Priority Recommendation Example **Full feature set** Internal with Aim + ESP [Mason Deadlock](/en/products/deadlock-mason/) **Information advantage** ESP-focused [Phoenix Deadlock](/en/products/phoenix-deadlock/) **Budget option** Basic internal [Coconut Deadlock](/en/products/coconut-deadlock/) Using Cheats in Deadlock VAC — Deceptive Leniency VAC seems like an easy anti-cheat, but its strategy of silent data accumulation is dangerous. A cheat might work for weeks — then a ban wave hits everyone who used a certain build. Recommendations: Use a spoofer — even in a VAC game, HWID bans are possible. Spoofer catalog Don’t play rage — VACNet analyzes statistics. Inhuman KD and hit percentages = priority review Play on a spare account — a Deadlock ban may affect other Valve games (CS2, Dota 2) on the same account MOBA Elements and Suspicion Deadlock is a team game with MOBA mechanics. This creates additional risks: Don’t farm jungle “blindly” — if you always know where camps spawn and arrive at perfect timing, it’s noticeable Don’t intercept every urn — if you always end up in the urn’s path, it’s suspicious Let yourself get ganked — if you’re “never caught,” teammates and opponents will notice More tips in our safe cheat usage guide . Outlook Deadlock is in active development. Valve may: Strengthen anti-cheat (add kernel component, like VACNet in CS2) Add an Overwatch system (manual replay review) Change mechanics, breaking existing cheats This means Deadlock cheats will need regular updates, and choosing a proven developer (Mason, Phoenix) is an investment in stability. Conclusion Deadlock is a relatively cheat-friendly game thanks to VAC (user-mode). However, wave bans and VACNet development require caution. Mason Deadlock offers the best feature balance for the game’s current state. When choosing, prioritize ESP — in a MOBA-shooter, map information matters more than pure aim. All Deadlock cheats on IVSOFTE — verified private cheats for Valve’s new shooter. Go to Deadlock catalog → 🎮 Dominate Deadlock with our software Statuses update automatically; ambiguous cases are reviewed manually. Sales may be paused during extended updates. Open the catalog →",
